723d94cc899f3ad2c75fbf49f9192984  post_badge8.ss1  PINNED  THE §Ch22 OUTPUT FIXTURE — and §Ch23's START. Captured 2026-09-03 by `--driver ch22chapter` with `CH22_CAPTURE` on FULL ACCEPTANCE (badge, out of the gym, b1f_entered, battles_on_B1F=0, CONTINUE=23), so the file's EXISTENCE is the acceptance record. Probe-verified (probe_anchor_inventory, whose own positive control passed first): OVERWORLD SOOTOPOLIS_CITY (31,33), **badges=12345678 — ALL EIGHT**, party 6. ⚠⚠ **428/701 (61%) WITH ONE MEMBER FAINTED** — the probe itself flags it "CANNOT SURVIVE A JOURNEY". This is NOT a defect in the fixture: §Ch22 genuinely chews the party (contrast `post_hm07.ss1` at 91% with none down), because the Juan fight is stochastic and the chapter may fight it twice. ⇒ **§Ch23's FIRST act must be a heal**, and its preflight must assert the party by PID afterwards — the Sootopolis Poke Center is 23 wp away and measured reachable. ⛔ AND THE OCEAN LEG THAT FOLLOWS HAS NO ESCAPE: `allow_escaping: false` on Sootopolis, Routes 126/127/128 and every underwater map, with NO Poke Center until Ever Grande. ‼ Wailmer is the SOLE Dive carrier and Dive is the ONLY exit from the crater — any change that could cost it strands the run. (As of this capture Wailmer knows Dive/Surf/Water Gun/Rollout; `--driver ch23teach` replaces Rollout with Waterfall and KEEPS both HMs.)
3eec11dbaa5deae51288cfa34e198536  post_waterfall.ss1  PINNED  §Ch23's WORKING START — `post_badge8.ss1` with WATERFALL TAUGHT. Captured 2026-09-03 by `--driver ch23teach` with `CH23_CAPTURE` on FULL ACCEPTANCE (Waterfall present by PID, Dive AND Surf both survived, party intact 6->6), so the file's EXISTENCE is the record. Driver-verified: Wailmer#FA51ECF3 = Dive / Surf / Water Gun / **Waterfall** (Rollout was the move forgotten — slot 3, the deepest forget-menu scroll this bot has driven). Probe-verified (`--driver ch23route`, read-only): all EIGHT badges, SOOTOPOLIS_CITY (31,33), **ROUTE128_STATE=2** (the ON_FRAME Kyogre scene is SPENT), and the bag holds HM02/03/04/06/07/08 but **NOT HM01 Cut and NOT HM05 Flash**. ⛔⛔ **WAILMER IS THE SINGLE POINT OF FAILURE FOR THE WHOLE CHAPTER** — it is the SOLE carrier of Dive (the only exit from the Sootopolis crater) AND of Waterfall (the only way up to Victory Road), and it also carries Surf. Anything that could deposit or lose it strands the run; §Ch23's preflight must assert it BY PID. ⛔⛔ **THE FAINTED MEMBER IS WAILMER ITSELF — measured 2026-09-03 by `--driver partypids`: `Wailmer#FA51ECF3 hp=0/160 FAINTED`, Swellow 5/118 (4%), the other four at 100%.** So the chapter's SOLE Dive+Waterfall carrier starts DEAD, and the opening heal is a HARD PRECONDITION, not hygiene. ‼ This entry previously said only "61% HP with one member fainted" while naming the SPOF in a separate sentence; the hazard is their CONJUNCTION and nothing joined them. ⇒ assert Wailmer ALIVE **by PID** — a party count reads 6 either way.
